// Title: Potential DLL Sideloading Of MsCorSvc.DLL
// Rule ID: cdb15e19-c2d0-432a-928e-e49c8c60dcf2
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.persistence, attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1574.001
// Category: image_load
